      "text": "I should make these plates, 1 Ne. 9:3. bow, which was made of fine steel, 1 Ne. 16:18. did make tools of the ore, 1 Ne. 17:16. I did teach my people to build, 2 Ne. 5:15. their skill was in the bow, Enos 1:20. became exceedingly rich … in buildings, and in machinery, and also in iron, Jarom 1:8. prepared his people with breastplates, Alma 43:19. erecting small forts … building walls of stone, Alma 48:8. Hagoth … built him an exceedingly large ship, Alma 63:5. exceedingly expert in the working of cement, Hel. 3:7. did build barges, Ether 2:6 (2:16–17). did molten out of a rock sixteen small stones, Ether 3:1. did work in all manner of ore, Ether 10:23.",
